MODULAR MONOLITH BACKEND + SEPARATE FRONTEND + POSTGRESQL + REDIS + EXTERNAL PROVIDER ADAPTERS

Stack công nghệ.
    Frontend-React+Typescript+Vite
    Routing-React Router
    Server state-Tanstack Query
    Client state-Zustand
    Styling-CSS Modules hoặc Css architecture riêng
    Chart-Lightweight charts
    Backend-Nestjs+Websocket
    ORM-Prisma
    Database-POSTGRESQL
    Cache-REDIS
    Queue-BullMQ
    Validation-Zod hoặc class-validator
    AUTH-JWT-Refresh token
    API Docs-Swagger
    Testing-Vitest+supertest+playwright
    Container-Docker Compose
    CI-Github actions
    Reverse Proxy-Nginx hoặc cloud proxy
    Monitoring-Structured logs + Error tracking.

